    <item>
      <title>Transcriptional Response to Chronic Long-Access Fentanyl Self-Administration in Rat Habenula and Amygdala</title>
      <link>https://lcolladotor.github.io/publication/2026_07_fentanyl_rat_hb_amy/</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 14 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://lcolladotor.github.io/publication/2026_07_fentanyl_rat_hb_amy/</guid>
      <description>&lt;blockquote class=&#34;bluesky-embed&#34; data-bluesky-uri=&#34;at://did:plc:ov45ekuxlvq4se3ltfkf2den/app.bsky.feed.post/3mruonpfjgc2z&#34; data-bluesky-cid=&#34;bafyreihi3cyfrucadkqvdv7nzpr6iflep5s5q7stdxss2dxk7ah44piq7i&#34; data-bluesky-embed-color-mode=&#34;system&#34;&gt;&lt;p lang=&#34;en&#34;&gt;🧠🧬 What are the effects of intravenous fentanyl self-administration on the habenula and amygdala transcriptomes?
&lt;p&gt;In our new Addiction Biology paper, we addressed this question using a chronic long-access model in rats! Here are some highlights 🧵👇&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Paper 👉 dx.doi.org/10.1111/adb&amp;hellip;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;https://bsky.app/profile/did:plc:ov45ekuxlvq4se3ltfkf2den/post/3mruonpfjgc2z?ref_src=embed&#34;&gt;[image or embed]&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;— Robin Magnard (&lt;a href=&#34;https://bsky.app/profile/did:plc:ov45ekuxlvq4se3ltfkf2den?ref_src=embed&#34;&gt;@robinmagnard.bsky.social&lt;/a&gt;) &lt;a href=&#34;https://bsky.app/profile/did:plc:ov45ekuxlvq4se3ltfkf2den/post/3mruonpfjgc2z?ref_src=embed&#34;&gt;July 30, 2026 at 10:48 AM&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;script async src=&#34;https://embed.bsky.app/static/embed.js&#34; charset=&#34;utf-8&#34;&gt;&lt;/script&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
